able</span></div><div class="focus-metric learn"><strong>${fmt(tot.learn)}</strong><span>Learning</span></div><div class="focus-metric new"><strong>${fmt(tot.new)}</strong><span>New available</span></div><span class="scope-note">${icon('focus',15)}Selected folders only · Anki’s limits apply</span></div>`:''}</section>`;
    }
    function revisitPanel(){
      const recent=state.profile.recent_locations.map(id=>state.map.get(id)).filter(Boolean).slice(0,4);
